From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:56:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer: keep an external subtitle within a Blu-ray
 playlist

In navigation mode each non-seamless item of a Blu-ray playlist opens as
a new stream. The current subtitle was cleared there, so an external
subtitle file was lost at every such join and the disc's own subtitle
took its place. An external file runs on the title time of its playlist,
which the next item of the same playlist continues.
